    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tails</strong> is a thrilling interactive adventure where you step into the paws of a raccoon fighting to survive in the mysterious wild. Venture into the unknown, where every bush, tree, and underground tunnel hides secrets and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Wild Environment</strong>: Immerse yourself in a picturesque world of forests, mountains, and waterscapes, competing for survival among other wild animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and Seasonal Changes</strong>: Experience the effects of storms, snowfall, and spring blooms on your survival strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shelter and Trap Building</strong>: Showcase your survival skills by building shelters and placing traps to outsmart predators and secure your territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong>: Survive solo or form alliances with other players to share responsibilities like gathering food and defending from predators.<strong>Available within a month after release</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tails</strong> takes you to the heart of nature, where every day is a new challenge and an unforgettable adventure. Explore the mysterious forest with your own paws, prove your survival prowess, and master the art of shelter and trap crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tails</strong> is a thrilling interactive adventure where you step into the paws of a raccoon fighting to survive in the mysterious wild. Venture into the unknown, where every bush, tree, and underground tunnel hides secrets and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Wild Environment</strong>: Immerse yourself in a picturesque world of forests, mountains, and waterscapes, competing for survival among other wild animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and Seasonal Changes</strong>: Experience the effects of storms, snowfall, and spring blooms on your survival strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shelter and Trap Building</strong>: Showcase your survival skills by building shelters and placing traps to outsmart predators and secure your territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong>: Survive solo or form alliances with other players to share responsibilities like gathering food and defending from predators.<strong>Available within a month after release</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twilight Tails</strong> takes you to the heart of nature, where every day is a new challenge and an unforgettable adventure. Explore the mysterious forest with your own paws, prove your survival prowess, and master the art of shelter and trap crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
